  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling up of interventions to combat malaria in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire - C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire (01-Jan-2024-31-Dec-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire, Malaria, Save the Children Federation, Inc. (STC HQ)This program has the following goals: Contribuer de mani&#xe8;re significative &#xe0; l&apos;am&#xe9;lioration du bien-&#xea;tre de la population en r&#xe9;duisant le fardeau du paludisme d&apos;ici 2026.  - (Make a significant contribution to improving the well-being of the population by reducing the burden of malaria by 2026.).  R&#xe9;duire d&apos;au moins 75% la mortalit&#xe9; due au paludisme d&apos;ici 2025 par rapport &#xe0; 2015. The objectives of this program are: D&apos;ici fin 2026, r&#xe9;duire les taux de mortalit&#xe9; li&#xe9; au paludisme d&apos;au moins 75% par rapport &#xe0; 2015  - (By the end of 2026, reduce malaria mortality rates by at least 75% compared to 2015.).  D&apos;ici fin 2026, r&#xe9;duire l&apos;incidence des cas de paludisme d&apos;au moins 75% par rapport &#xe0; 2015 - (By the end of 2026, reduce the incidence of malaria by at least 75% compared to 2015.).  D&apos;ici fin 2026, renforcer et maintenir les capacit&#xe9;s de gestion, de coordination et de partenariat du programme pour atteindre les performances &#xe0; tous les niveaux. - (By the end of 2026, strengthen and maintain the program&apos;s management, coordination, and partnership capabilities in order to achieve performance at all levels.)</narrative>
  </description>
